1
00:00:00,850 --> 00:00:02,920
(Howard:)Well, that and jiggling
her arm fat.

2
00:00:05,690 --> 00:00:08,320
(Leonard:)I can't believe we're going
all the way to San Diego

3
00:00:08,330 --> 00:00:10,090
(Leonard:)to confront this guy.

4
00:00:10,090 --> 00:00:12,730
(Howard:)Yeah, we're kind of
bad-asses, aren't we?

5
00:00:12,730 --> 00:00:14,100
(Raj:)Totally.

6
00:00:14,100 --> 00:00:15,970
(Raj:)Hey, how about
we stay the night

7
00:00:15,970 --> 00:00:18,440
(Raj:)and hit Legoland
in the morning?

8
00:00:18,440 --> 00:00:20,040
(Sheldon:)Sea World is better.

9
00:00:20,040 --> 00:00:24,070
(Sheldon:)It has Shamu, who is
literally tons of fun.

10
00:00:24,070 --> 00:00:27,340
(Sheldon:)But for the moment, let's stay
focused on Todd Zarnecki.

11
00:00:27,340 --> 00:00:30,010
(Raj:)Yeah, we're coming for you,
Todd Zarnecki.

12
00:00:30,010 --> 00:00:33,520
(Raj:)And for the record, Legoland
is more interactive.

13
00:00:34,190 --> 00:00:35,590
(Sheldon:)I almost feel sorry

14
00:00:35,590 --> 00:00:39,190
(Sheldon:)for the poor fool, sitting in
his split-level suburban ranch,

15
00:00:39,190 --> 00:00:40,520
(Sheldon:)unaware that

16
00:00:40,520 --> 00:00:44,230
a vengeful horde is barreling
down the San Diego Freeway

17
00:00:44,230 --> 00:00:46,460
(Sheldon:)at 71 miles an hour.

18
00:00:46,460 --> 00:00:47,930
(Sheldon:)Ease up there, lead foot.

19
00:00:47,930 --> 00:00:49,400
(Sheldon:)You trying to get us killed?

20
00:00:51,040 --> 00:00:53,640
(Raj:)I took the liberty
of burning us

21
00:00:53,640 --> 00:00:55,740
(Raj:)a mix of heroic
questing music.

22
00:00:57,240 --> 00:01:01,020
This says "Beyonce
Bootylicious Dance Mix."

